# Setting Bible — Background Settings (世界观设定)

## Goal
List the novel's background settings: everything about the world that is NOT a character.

## Requirements
- Output a list of plain strings; one fact per item, self-contained.
- Cover: the world premise, tone, power system / world rules and their limits, world taboos, factions and their stances, key terminology with canonical spellings, and foreshadowing the outline anchors.
- Skeleton-first: the core foundation only; the bible grows with the story.
- Keep the list compact — about 10-20 facts, each one to two sentences.
- Timeless facts only: anything that changes over time (current ranks, relationship progress, arc stage) does not belong here.

